            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sweet? (شیرین, shirin.) Fat? (چاق, châgh.) Light? (سبک, sabok.) Heavy? (سنگین, sangin.) Right? (درست, dorost.) Important? (مهم, mohem.) Beautiful? (زیبا, zibâ.) Green? (سبز, sabz.) Yellow? (زرد, zard.) Red? (قرمز, ghermez.) Blue? (آبی, âbi.) Black? (سیاه, siyâh.) White? (سفید, sefid.) A week? (هفته, hafte.) A year? (سال, sâl.) A minute? (دقیقه, daghighe.) Today? (امروز, emruz.) Yesterday? (دیروز, diruz.) Tomorrow? (فردا, fardâ.) Now? (حالا, hâlâ.) Always? (همیشه, hamishe.) Sometimes? (گاهی, gâhi.) Early? (زود, zud.) Late? (دیر, dir.) Before? (قبل, ghabl.) Morning? (صبح, sobh.) Night? (شب, shab.) A day? (روز, ruz.) Far? (دور, dur.) Near? (نزدیک, nazdik.) Inside? (داخل, dâkhel.) Outside? (بیرون, birun.) Up? (بالا, bâlâ.) Down? (پایین, pâyin.) In front? (جلو, jolow.) Here? (اینجا, injâ.) There? (آنجا, ânjâ.) Right; true? (راست, râst.) Left? (چپ, chap.) A street? (خیابان, khiyâbân.)"
            }
